# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
logs/
coverage/
tmp/
temp/
*.tmp
*.csv
*.xlsx
*.pdf
!MOBILE_TEST_CHECKLIST.md

